<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-mixins-1/#defining-custom-functions" rel="nofollow">CSS custom functions</a> have <a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5179721933651968" rel="nofollow">landed in Chrome 139</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">This PR documents all of the associated sub-features that make up this feature. Specifically, it adds pages for:</p>
<ul class="contains-task-list">
